y and Research (AITR), Bypass Road, Square, Mangliya Sadak, Indore, Madhya Pradesh Platform: Any coding platform is allowed within the premises (e.g., VSCode, Sublime, GitHub) Note : The link for the problem statements and the PPT format will be shared soon. Additional Information: Participants must arrange their own travel. Free stay with locker, breakfast, lunch, and dinner. Lockers will be provided, but you have to bring your own locks. Registration fees are non-refundable under any circumstances",
